        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Renáta Tomanová, Larisa Savchenko-Neiland, Billy Martin, Anne Smith, Stanislav Birner\n- Places: Czechoslovakia, Soviet Union, Latvia\n- Events: 1980 French Open – Mixed Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players, mixed doubles finalists, mixed doubles champions\n\nFacts:\n- Renáta Tomanová was born on 9 December 1954 and is a former professional tennis player from Czechoslovakia.\n- Larisa Savchenko-Neiland, née Savchenko, was born on 21 July 1966 and is a former professional tennis player who represented the Soviet Union and Latvia.\n- Billy Martin and Anne Smith won the 1980 French Open mixed doubles title by defeating Stanislav Birner and Renáta Tomanová in the final.",
